        inaction were an action or inaction of Customer.`}),(0,s.jsx)("li",{children:`Section 4 of the Agreement is hereby amended by inserting the following Section 4.C
        immediately after Section 4.B: Customer hereby grants Figma a worldwide, non-exclusive,
